---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Button from "../components/ui/Button.astro";
import Card from "../components/ui/Card.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About Me" description="Learn more about Yosepri Berutu and my AI-assisted full-stack development workflow.">
  <div class="py-24">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-5xl">
      <header class="mb-14">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">Hi, I’m Yosepri Disyandro Berutu.</h1>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-muted-foreground max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
          I’m a backend engineer based in Jakarta, currently working on high-scale payment systems while helping founders and small teams ship MVPs, admin dashboards, and backend APIs with a practical AI-assisted workflow.
        </p>
      </header>

      <section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-14">
        <Card class="p-6">
          <h2 class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground mb-3">What I Build</h2>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
            Product MVPs, internal tools, and API-driven systems that can be deployed and maintained in production.
          </p>
        </Card>
        <Card class="p-6">
          <h2 class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground mb-3">Primary Strength</h2>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
            Backend architecture, API design, event-driven systems, and payment-domain workflows, while still comfortable handling frontend and deployment end-to-end.
          </p>
        </Card>
        <Card class="p-6">
          <h2 class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground mb-3">Current Focus</h2>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
            Freelance collaboration for teams that need fast execution with clear technical judgment and clean delivery.
          </p>
        </Card>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-14">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-5">Professional Experience</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6">
          <Card class="p-6">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between gap-2 mb-4">
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-semibold">Software Development Engineer Backend</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">PT. Aliansi Teknologi Indonesia (DANA Indonesia)</p>
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Apr 2022 – Present</p>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              DANA is one of Indonesia’s leading digital wallet and digital payments platforms, serving millions of users and merchant transactions.
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mt-3">
              I’m part of the core backend team and have handled systems across the full payment flow: front-line backend services hit directly by users
              (both customer app and merchant app), business-logic layers for acquiring and fund products, fund-flow/money-movement processing,
              system communication with external third-party partners, and push notification backend services for user communication.
            </p>
          </Card>
          <Card class="p-6">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between gap-2 mb-4">
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-semibold">Associate Software Development Engineer Backend</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">PT. Global Digital Niaga (Blibli.com)</p>
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Sep 2021 – Mar 2022</p>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              Built and maintained finance-tech backend services, collaborated in a cross-functional Scrum team, and handled delivery from implementation
              through production support.
            </p>
          </Card>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-14">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-5">Technical Background</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <Card class="p-6">
            <h3 class="font-semibold mb-3">Core Stack</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
              <li><strong>Languages:</strong> Java, Go, PHP, Python, TypeScript</li>
              <li><strong>Frameworks:</strong> SOFA Boot (Spring-based), Spring Boot, React, Astro, Laravel, Flask</li>
              <li><strong>Data:</strong> OceanBase, MySQL, PostgreSQL, Redis, NoSQL</li>
            </ul>
          </Card>
          <Card class="p-6">
            <h3 class="font-semibold mb-3">Infrastructure & Platform</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
              <li><strong>Containers:</strong> Docker, Docker Compose</li>
              <li><strong>Proxy:</strong> Caddy, Nginx</li>
              <li><strong>Messaging/Scheduler:</strong> Kafka, RabbitMQ, event-driven scheduler patterns</li>
              <li><strong>Platform/Observability:</strong> Apache Nifi, Grafana, Splunk, Jenkins, GitHub Actions</li>
            </ul>
          </Card>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-14">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-5">Education</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <Card class="p-6">
            <h3 class="font-semibold">Bina Nusantara University</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1">Bachelor Degree of Information System</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1">Oct 2022 – Oct 2024 · GPA 3.98/4.00</p>
          </Card>
          <Card class="p-6">
            <h3 class="font-semibold">Del Institute of Technology</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1">Associate Degree of Information Technology</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1">Graduated Sep 2021 · GPA 3.70/4.00</p>
          </Card>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-14">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-5">AI-Assisted Workflow</h2>
        <Card class="p-6">
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            I use AI to accelerate planning, scaffolding, debugging, and documentation. The key is still human engineering review at every stage.
          </p>
          <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
            <li>Requirement breakdown and technical planning</li>
            <li>UI and component iteration</li>
            <li>API scaffolding and implementation support</li>
            <li>Review, hardening, and production-readiness checks</li>
          </ul>
        </Card>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-14">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-5">How I Work</h2>
        <Card class="p-6">
          <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
            <li>Start with clear scope, constraints, and measurable outcomes.</li>
            <li>Translate requirements into actionable technical design.</li>
            <li>Build iteratively with fast feedback and visible progress.</li>
            <li>Prioritize reliability, observability, and maintainability.</li>
            <li>Document key decisions for handover and long-term ownership.</li>
            <li>Use AI to accelerate execution, with strict engineering review.</li>
          </ul>
        </Card>
      </section>

      <section class="pt-10 border-t border-border">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Open for Collaboration</h2>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-7 max-w-3xl">
          I’m currently available for freelance work focused on MVP development, admin dashboards, backend APIs, and deployment/debugging support.
        </p>
        <Button href="/contact">Get in Touch</Button>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
